{"id":"forecast-14","section":1,"path":"bank/listening/forecast-14/audio-1.m4a","model":"small","duration":465.26,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":2.32,"text":"You will hear a number of different recordings","words":[["You",0.0,0.34],["will",0.34,0.52],["hear",0.52,0.74],["a",0.74,0.9],["number",0.9,1.22],["of",1.22,1.46],["different",1.46,1.78],["recordings",1.78,2.32]]},{"start":2.94,"end":5.74,"text":"and you will have to answer questions on what you hear.","words":[["and",2.94,3.26],["you",3.26,3.42],["will",3.42,3.52],["have",3.52,3.68],["to",3.68,3.82],["answer",3.82,4.12],["questions",4.12,4.66],["on",4.66,5.02],["what",5.02,5.2],["you",5.2,5.38],["hear.",5.38,5.74]]},{"start":6.7,"end":10.02,"text":"There will be time for you to read the instructions and questions","words":[["There",6.7,7.08],["will",7.08,7.2],["be",7.2,7.34],["time",7.34,7.68],["for",7.68,7.96],["you",7.96,8.06],["to",8.06,8.16],["read",8.16,8.48],["the",8.48,8.74],["instructions",8.74,9.3],["and",9.3,9.66],["questions",9.66,10.02]]},{"start":10.68,"end":12.94,"text":"and you will have a chance to check your work.","words":[["and",10.68,11.0],["you",11.0,11.18],["will",11.18,11.28],["have",11.28,11.42],["a",11.42,11.56],["chance",11.56,11.82],["to",11.82,12.04],["check",12.04,12.34],["your",12.34,12.54],["work.",12.54,12.94]]},{"start":14.18,"end":17.18,"text":"All the recordings will be played once only.","words":[["All",14.18,14.48],["the",14.48,14.62],["recordings",14.62,15.04],["will",15.04,15.44],["be",15.44,15.58],["played",15.58,16.0],["once",16.0,16.5],["only.",16.5,17.18]]},{"start":18.68,"end":21.0,"text":"The test is in four parts.","words":[["The",18.68,18.96],["test",18.96,19.36],["is",19.36,19.94],["in",19.94,20.06],["four",20.06,20.44],["parts.",20.44,21.0]]},{"start":21.84,"end":25.36,"text":"Write all your answers in the listening question booklet.","words":[["Write",21.84,22.34],["all",22.34,22.64],["your",22.64,22.8],["answers",22.8,23.28],["in",23.28,23.88],["the",23.88,24.02],["listening",24.02,24.36],["question",24.36,24.9],["booklet.",24.9,25.36]]},{"start":25.36,"end":31.48,"text":"At the end of the test, you will be given ten minutes to transfer your answers to an","words":[["At",25.36,25.92],["the",25.92,26.82],["end",26.82,27.02],["of",27.02,27.14],["the",27.14,27.22],["test,",27.22,27.56],["you",28.04,28.26],["will",28.26,28.36],["be",28.36,28.52],["given",28.52,28.78],["ten",28.78,29.14],["minutes",29.14,29.54],["to",29.54,29.82],["transfer",29.82,30.38],["your",30.38,30.62],["answers",30.62,31.0],["to",31.0,31.3],["an",31.3,31.48]]},{"start":31.48,"end":38.28,"text":"answer sheet. Now turn to part one on page two of your question booklet.","words":[["answer",31.48,31.78],["sheet.",31.78,32.16],["Now",34.18,34.54],["turn",34.54,34.8],["to",34.8,35.0],["part",35.0,35.2],["one",35.2,35.58],["on",35.58,36.38],["page",36.38,36.72],["two",36.72,37.2],["of",37.2,37.4],["your",37.4,37.52],["question",37.52,37.84],["booklet.",37.84,38.28]]},{"start":43.43,"end":49.37,"text":"Part one. You will hear a man speaking on the phone to a sales assistant at a toy company.","words":[["Part",43.43,43.67],["one.",43.67,44.05],["You",44.93,45.11],["will",45.11,45.27],["hear",45.27,45.47],["a",45.47,45.69],["man",45.69,45.89],["speaking",45.89,46.37],["on",46.37,46.69],["the",46.69,46.79],["phone",46.79,47.13],["to",47.13,47.37],["a",47.37,47.51],["sales",47.51,47.81],["assistant",47.81,48.33],["at",48.33,48.63],["a",48.63,48.73],["toy",48.73,48.95],["company.",48.95,49.37]]},{"start":50.45,"end":86.22,"text":"First you have some time to look at questions one to six. Now listen carefully and answer","words":[["First",50.45,50.83],["you",50.83,51.09],["have",51.09,51.23],["some",51.23,51.39],["time",51.39,51.69],["to",51.69,51.87],["look",51.87,52.05],["at",52.05,52.21],["questions",52.21,52.57],["one",52.57,53.09],["to",53.09,53.39],["six.",53.39,53.77],["Now",84.18,84.56],["listen",84.56,84.9],["carefully",84.9,85.38],["and",85.38,85.82],["answer",85.82,86.22]]},{"start":86.22,"end":87.98,"text":"questions one to six.","words":[["questions",86.22,86.7],["one",86.7,87.26],["to",87.26,87.58],["six.",87.58,87.98]]},{"start":90.77,"end":95.93,"text":"Hello, Ramona Toys. You're through to Tracy. How can I help you?","words":[["Hello,",90.77,91.91],["Ramona",92.19,92.55],["Toys.",92.55,93.05],["You're",93.49,93.89],["through",93.89,94.05],["to",94.05,94.21],["Tracy.",94.21,94.55],["How",95.11,95.27],["can",95.27,95.43],["I",95.43,95.53],["help",95.53,95.69],["you?",95.69,95.93]]},{"start":96.45,"end":102.39,"text":"Good morning. I want to buy birthday presents for my sister's children. She's very keen","words":[["Good",96.45,96.69],["morning.",96.69,96.95],["I",97.55,97.97],["want",97.97,98.19],["to",98.19,98.39],["buy",98.39,98.57],["birthday",98.57,99.01],["presents",99.01,99.57],["for",99.57,99.79],["my",99.79,99.97],["sister's",99.97,100.47],["children.",100.47,101.01],["She's",101.55,101.93],["very",101.93,102.11],["keen",102.11,102.39]]},{"start":102.39,"end":105.61,"text":"on educational toys. Do you sell that sort of thing?","words":[["on",102.39,102.55],["educational",102.55,103.03],["toys.",103.03,103.63],["Do",104.27,104.49],["you",104.49,104.65],["sell",104.65,104.91],["that",104.91,105.11],["sort",105.11,105.31],["of",105.31,105.45],["thing?",105.45,105.61]]},{"start":106.35,"end":112.13,"text":"Yes. Actually, we specialize in those types of toys. How old are the children?","words":[["Yes.",106.35,106.77],["Actually,",107.39,107.87],["we",107.93,108.11],["specialize",108.11,108.59],["in",108.59,109.05],["those",109.05,109.27],["types",109.27,109.61],["of",109.61,109.79],["toys.",109.79,110.11],["How",110.89,111.27],["old",111.27,111.53],["are",111.53,111.67],["the",111.67,111.75],["children?",111.75,112.13]]},{"start":112.81,"end":117.93,"text":"Well, Peter, he's the oldest. He's going to be nine next week.","words":[["Well,",112.81,113.27],["Peter,",113.59,113.85],["he's",114.35,114.71],["the",114.71,114.85],["oldest.",114.85,115.19],["He's",115.93,116.33],["going",116.33,116.57],["to",116.57,116.79],["be",116.79,116.97],["nine",116.97,117.27],["next",117.27,117.67],["week.",117.67,117.93]]},{"start":117.93,"end":121.61,"text":"Did you have anything particular in mind for him?","words":[["Did",117.93,118.91],["you",118.91,119.13],["have",119.13,119.37],["anything",119.37,119.75],["particular",119.75,120.55],["in",120.55,120.83],["mind",120.83,121.11],["for",121.11,121.43],["him?",121.43,121.61]]},{"start":122.13,"end":127.43,"text":"I got him a jigsaw last year, but I'd like to get him something a bit more challenging","words":[["I",122.13,122.53],["got",122.53,122.75],["him",122.75,122.97],["a",122.97,123.07],["jigsaw",123.07,123.59],["last",123.59,123.87],["year,",123.87,124.29],["but",124.65,124.99],["I'd",124.99,125.53],["like",125.53,125.65],["to",125.65,125.81],["get",125.81,125.93],["him",125.93,126.07],["something",126.07,126.31],["a",126.31,126.55],["bit",126.55,126.63],["more",126.63,126.85],["challenging",126.85,127.43]]},{"start":127.43,"end":130.43,"text":"this time, perhaps something he could make himself.","words":[["this",127.43,127.83],["time,",127.83,128.13],["perhaps",128.67,128.95],["something",128.95,129.33],["he",129.33,129.55],["could",129.55,129.69],["make",129.69,129.89],["himself.",129.89,130.43]]},{"start":131.05,"end":132.83,"text":"How about a model truck?","words":[["How",131.05,131.57],["about",131.57,131.85],["a",131.85,132.11],["model",132.11,132.37],["truck?",132.37,132.83]]},{"start":133.63,"end":134.77,"text":"Might that be any good?","words":[["Might",133.63,133.91],["that",133.91,134.15],["be",134.15,134.33],["any",134.33,134.51],["good?",134.51,134.77]]},{"start":135.57,"end":142.75,"text":"It's made of wood, it comes in a kit, so you get all the pieces, and then there are","words":[["It's",135.57,135.99],["made",135.99,136.21],["of",136.21,136.43],["wood,",136.43,136.77],["it",137.33,137.61],["comes",137.61,137.99],["in",137.99,138.19],["a",138.19,138.33],["kit,",138.33,138.69],["so",139.09,139.43],["you",139.43,139.69],["get",139.69,139.91],["all",139.91,140.19],["the",140.19,140.31],["pieces,",140.31,140.75],["and",141.37,141.89],["then",141.89,142.37],["there",142.37,142.61],["are",142.61,142.75]]},{"start":142.75,"end":144.15,"text":"the electrical components.","words":[["the",142.75,142.91],["electrical",142.91,143.45],["components.",143.45,144.15]]},{"start":144.67,"end":147.05,"text":"Oh, it's not just mechanical then?","words":[["Oh,",144.67,145.01],["it's",145.25,145.61],["not",145.61,145.77],["just",145.77,146.13],["mechanical",146.13,146.71],["then?",146.71,147.05]]},{"start":147.05,"end":155.39,"text":"Oh no, it's quite sophisticated. It's recommended for children over eight and you also get a","words":[["Oh",147.05,147.63],["no,",147.63,147.87],["it's",148.39,148.67],["quite",148.67,148.87],["sophisticated.",148.87,149.41],["It's",150.35,150.77],["recommended",150.77,151.21],["for",151.21,151.59],["children",151.59,151.95],["over",151.95,152.35],["eight",152.35,152.87],["and",152.87,153.93],["you",153.93,154.19],["also",154.19,154.73],["get",154.73,155.17],["a",155.17,155.39]]},{"start":155.39,"end":157.25,"text":"sheet of stickers to decorate it.","words":[["sheet",155.39,155.61],["of",155.61,155.79],["stickers",155.79,156.23],["to",156.23,156.49],["decorate",156.49,156.83],["it.",156.83,157.25]]},{"start":157.61,"end":163.49,"text":"That sounds just up his street and I'm sure it'd help him to understand technology even","words":[["That",157.61,158.07],["sounds",158.07,158.39],["just",158.39,158.65],["up",158.65,158.91],["his",158.91,159.09],["street",159.09,159.39],["and",159.39,160.29],["I'm",160.29,160.43],["sure",160.43,160.61],["it'd",160.61,160.81],["help",160.81,161.03],["him",161.03,161.19],["to",161.19,161.29],["understand",161.29,161.83],["technology",161.83,162.65],["even",162.65,163.49]]},{"start":163.49,"end":164.57,"text":"if it's only basic.","words":[["if",163.49,163.67],["it's",163.67,163.87],["only",163.87,164.11],["basic.",164.11,164.57]]},{"start":165.01,"end":170.11,"text":"Well yes, and it is a change from the chemistry sets we used to get.","words":[["Well",165.01,165.33],["yes,",165.33,165.77],["and",166.45,166.99],["it",166.99,167.19],["is",167.19,167.37],["a",167.37,167.53],["change",167.53,167.85],["from",167.85,168.05],["the",168.05,168.19],["chemistry",168.19,168.51],["sets",168.51,169.05],["we",169.05,169.37],["used",169.37,169.71],["to",169.71,169.85],["get.",169.85,170.11]]},{"start":170.69,"end":175.89,"text":"Oh, you had one of those too, did you? Um, what about price?","words":[["Oh,",170.69,170.97],["you",171.35,171.79],["had",171.79,172.01],["one",172.01,172.17],["of",172.17,172.27],["those",172.27,172.45],["too,",172.45,172.77],["did",172.85,172.97],["you?",172.97,173.21],["Um,",174.21,174.63],["what",175.09,175.29],["about",175.29,175.47],["price?",175.47,175.89]]},{"start":177.37,"end":179.35,"text":"It's £17.50.","words":[["It's",177.37,177.93],["£17",177.93,178.49],[".50.",178.49,179.35]]},{"start":180.25,"end":184.45,"text":"Hmm. It's not too expensive then. I could get him something else as well.","words":[["Hmm.",180.25,180.51],["It's",180.81,181.05],["not",181.05,181.17],["too",181.17,181.39],["expensive",181.39,181.85],["then.",181.85,182.11],["I",182.67,182.87],["could",182.87,183.05],["get",183.05,183.23],["him",183.23,183.33],["something",183.33,183.59],["else",183.59,183.95],["as",183.95,184.13],["well.",184.13,184.45]]},{"start":185.21,"end":187.23,"text":"He's always been interested in animals.","words":[["He's",185.21,185.55],["always",185.55,185.89],["been",185.89,186.17],["interested",186.17,186.61],["in",186.61,186.89],["animals.",186.89,187.23]]},{"start":187.61,"end":189.91,"text":"How about a book about jungle animals?","words":[["How",187.61,187.81],["about",187.81,188.13],["a",188.13,188.29],["book",188.29,188.47],["about",188.47,188.81],["jungle",188.81,189.29],["animals?",189.29,189.91]]},{"start":190.39,"end":192.63,"text":"Hmm. I think he's already got one.","words":[["Hmm.",190.39,190.69],["I",191.03,191.25],["think",191.25,191.49],["he's",191.49,191.77],["already",191.77,192.03],["got",192.03,192.35],["one.",192.35,192.63]]},{"start":193.23,"end":196.71,"text":"Okay. Well, how about a bird feeder instead?","words":[["Okay.",193.23,193.73],["Well,",194.35,194.73],["how",194.91,195.11],["about",195.11,195.39],["a",195.39,195.59],["bird",195.59,195.87],["feeder",195.87,196.23],["instead?",196.23,196.71]]},{"start":197.21,"end":203.35,"text":"That's a kit as well. You even get some paints and a brush so you can decorate it how you like.","words":[["That's",197.21,197.69],["a",197.69,197.81],["kit",197.81,197.99],["as",197.99,198.23],["well.",198.23,198.53],["You",198.79,198.93],["even",198.93,199.17],["get",199.17,199.41],["some",199.41,199.65],["paints",199.65,200.13],["and",200.13,200.79],["a",200.79,201.05],["brush",201.05,201.25],["so",201.25,201.69],["you",201.69,201.87],["can",201.87,202.03],["decorate",202.03,202.39],["it",202.39,202.73],["how",202.73,202.91],["you",202.91,203.09],["like.",203.09,203.35]]},{"start":203.35,"end":208.47,"text":"Well, that sounds just a thing. And it'll give him contact with wildlife.","words":[["Well,",203.35,203.95],["that",204.43,204.85],["sounds",204.85,205.13],["just",205.13,205.39],["a",205.39,205.57],["thing.",205.57,205.83],["And",206.29,206.79],["it'll",206.79,206.99],["give",206.99,207.13],["him",207.13,207.25],["contact",207.25,207.75],["with",207.75,207.97],["wildlife.",207.97,208.47]]},{"start":209.03,"end":216.77,"text":"Oh, I've just noticed something else in its favour. It's only £8.99 now. It's been reduced","words":[["Oh,",209.03,209.39],["I've",209.75,210.03],["just",210.03,210.29],["noticed",210.29,210.73],["something",210.73,211.09],["else",211.09,211.39],["in",211.39,211.53],["its",211.53,211.67],["favour.",211.67,212.05],["It's",212.85,213.17],["only",213.17,213.57